## Adding New Features Checklist

1. [ ] Define types in `src/types/index.ts`
2. [ ] Create React Query hooks in `src/hooks/api/{entity}.ts`
3. [ ] Export from `src/hooks/api/index.ts`
4. [ ] Create UI components in `src/components/`
5. [ ] Create page in `src/app/` with proper route structure
6. [ ] Add navigation links if needed
7. [ ] Handle loading/error/empty states
8. [ ] Add toast notifications for mutations
9. [ ] Test authentication flow if protected
10. [ ] Verify responsive design
